name: sim.getApiInfo
description: Returns the call tip (or info text) for an API function
luaSynopsis: string info = sim.getApiInfo(int scriptHandle, string apiWord)
pythonSynopsis: string info = sim.getApiInfo(int scriptHandle, string apiWord)
inputs:
1. scriptHandle: handle of the script. Can be -1 to be script agnostic
2. apiWord: API functions or variable to retrieve the info for, e.g. "sim.getObject"
outputs:
1. info: information related to the API function or variable
